OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLow cloud    
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain tends to ease         
OL,7,Fovernight, with a chillier night than  
OL,8,FMonday leading to patchy frost. Breezy 
OL,9,Fwinds persist over hills but will be   
OL,10,Flighter elsewhere.                     
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will be dry on Wednesday 
OL,13,Fbut cloudy, with the odd clear spell   
OL,14,Flater. It will feel chillier than      
OL,15,FTuesday with winds over hills easing   
OL,16,Fand a widespread frost overnight.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
